5. Mock data for your appliance store
You don't need a real database initially. Use JSON files to simulate an enterprise system.
Mock file	Example contents
products.json	Appliance ID, brand, model, price, features
inventory.json	SKU, stock quantity, warehouse
customers.json	Customer ID, name, contact
orders.json	Order ID, customer ID, items, delivery status
warranties.json	Product, purchase date, coverage details
returns.json	Return ID, reason, status
policies.json	Refund, warranty, delivery and escalation rules

For an Australian retailer, you could also model Australian Consumer Law rights separately from voluntary manufacturer warranties. That makes the refund and warranty workflows more realistic.
